  0005-session-lock-a-takeover-lock-hides-workspaces-from-i.patch
  0006-sendshortcut-keys-resolve-without-held-modifiers-the.patch
  0007-layer-shell-content-commits-damage-only-what-changed.patch
  0008-focus-restores-a-minimised-window-to-the-current-des.patch
  0009-direct-scanout-auto-mode-also-covers-fullscreen-vide.patch
  0010-render-covered-windows-get-frame-callbacks-at-most-e.patch
  0011-output-after-a-mode-change-rendering-waits-at-most-2.patch
  0012-render-frame-callbacks-carry-the-output-s-predicted-.patch
